# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the progression page (SEL + HOME twice) at Snap 100, stepped with
# F3 (key 0; F#3 is 1) both ways: REST (a tap steps, held the chord rests) and HOLD (held the chord plays, let go it
# rests). Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
wait 300
press SEL
tap HOME
release SEL
turn ALGO 10
wait 2500
wav progression-rest.wav
tapkey 0
wait 2500
key 0 down
wait 1200
shot progression-rest.png
key 0 up
wait 2500
tapkey 0
wait 1500
key 0 down
wait 1500
key 0 up
wait 2000
shot progression-steps.png
tapkey 1
wait 2500
wavstop
press SEL
key 0 down
key 0 up
release SEL
wait 500
wav progression-hold.wav
key 0 down
wait 1500
key 0 up
wait 1200
key 0 down
wait 1500
key 0 up
wait 1200
key 1 down
wait 1500
key 1 up
wait 1500
shot progression-hold.png
wavstop
